%% Delivery Readiness Check: gate flow (labels only; thresholds from checklist.md)
flowchart LR
    P([Pilot enters]) --> R[Review<br/>small batches]
    R --> B[Rollback<br/>version control + revert drill]
    B --> M[Measure<br/>change failure rate + lead time]
    M --> D{Score 20 or more of 24<br/>and no zero on A3, B2, C1, C4?}
    D -- yes --> S([Scale])
    D -- no --> F([Fix first])
